><item><title>你是他最好的药</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E4%BD%A0%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%96%E6%9C%80%E5%A5%BD%E7%9A%84%E8%8D%AF/</link><pubDate>Tue, 25 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Tue, 25 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E4%BD%A0%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%96%E6%9C%80%E5%A5%BD%E7%9A%84%E8%8D%AF/</guid><description>一、你是他最好的药 杨医生早安吉祥🙏 犬儿六天前发烧39.6，头两天没喂药。第三天开始吃猴枣散和羚羊角粉，今天37.4。 这三四天逐渐退烧时咳嗽相</description><dc:creator>医行天下</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%a4%a7%e4%ba%ba%20%e5%ad%a9%e5%ad%90%e4%b8%80%e8%b5%b7%e6%9d%a5%e5%81%a5%e8%84%be%e7%a5%9b%e6%b9%bf%20%e5%91%8a%e8%af%89%e4%bd%a0%e4%b8%80%e4%b8%aa%e4%b8%8d%e5%90%83%e8%8d%af%e7%9a%84%e5%a5%bd%e6%96%b9%e6%b3%95.assets/640-1705847798108-4.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>茶话会</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>想坐火箭</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%83%B3%E5%9D%90%E7%81%AB%E7%AE%AD/</link><pubDate>Wed, 12 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 12 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%83%B3%E5%9D%90%E7%81%AB%E7%AE%AD/</guid><description>师父您好： 没有学佛之前，觉得自己是个善良正直的人。通过十年的闻思，跟着师父们做善法，慢慢地才发现自己的各种习气。真是一言难尽，很羞愧。 作为凡</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%83%b3%e5%9d%90%e7%81%ab%e7%ae%ad.assets/640-1763486832949-77.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>茶话会</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>有些缘分是要珍惜的</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%9B%E7%BC%98%E5%88%86%E6%98%AF%E8%A6%81%E7%8F%8D%E6%83%9C%E7%9A%84/</link><pubDate>Wed, 05 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDat