or><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%bf%99%e6%ac%a1%e7%9a%84%e6%95%99%e8%ae%ad%e5%88%bb%e9%aa%a8%e9%93%ad%e5%bf%83.assets/640.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>茶话会</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>最美相遇（番外篇*必看）：记得他的好</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%9C%80%E7%BE%8E%E7%9B%B8%E9%81%87-%E7%95%AA%E5%A4%96%E7%AF%87%E5%BF%85%E7%9C%8B-%E8%AE%B0%E5%BE%97%E4%BB%96%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%BD/</link><pubDate>Thu, 04 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Thu, 04 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%9C%80%E7%BE%8E%E7%9B%B8%E9%81%87-%E7%95%AA%E5%A4%96%E7%AF%87%E5%BF%85%E7%9C%8B-%E8%AE%B0%E5%BE%97%E4%BB%96%E7%9A%84%E5%A5%BD/</guid><description>相关阅读： 最美相遇：1）健康是福 最美相遇：2）念恩报恩 最美相遇：3）大道至简 一、不离不弃·感恩 冥冥之中自有定数。回想自己如不是因为生病，像自</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%9c%80%e7%be%8e%e7%9b%b8%e9%81%87%20%e7%95%aa%e5%a4%96%e7%af%87%e5%bf%85%e7%9c%8b%20%e8%ae%b0%e5%be%97%e4%bb%96%e7%9a%84%e5%a5%bd.assets/640-1757632296318-3.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>修行分享</category><category>茶话会</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>茶话会：求而不得</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E8%8C%B6%E8%AF%9D%E4%BC%9A-%E6%B1%82%E8%80%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97/</link><pubDate>Tue, 02 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Tue, 02 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E8%8C%B6%E8%AF%9D%E4%BC%9A-%E6%B1%82%E8%80%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%BE%97/</guid><description>我是一个没有福报的人，总是“求而不得”。 诵经念咒可以消业带来转机，那么我就诵经念咒；放生可以提升福报，那么我就去放生；布施可以提升福报，那么</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:co